    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>SMASH!</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819510/extras/9a721cafe392116ed4ef4fcb50046a0f.poster.avif?t=1751998674\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819510/extras/9a721cafe392116ed4ef4fcb50046a0f.webm?t=1751998674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819510/extras/9a721cafe392116ed4ef4fcb50046a0f.mp4?t=1751998674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Smash</strong></u> stuff. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get <u><strong>rocks</strong></u>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Talk or Smash It's Your Choice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819510/extras/1037addd2e988cc714f2fe9b34ef4d08.poster.avif?t=1751998674\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819510/extras/1037addd2e988cc714f2fe9b34ef4d08.webm?t=1751998674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819510/extras/1037addd2e988cc714f2fe9b34ef4d08.mp4?t=1751998674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless</strong> transitions between <strong>battle</strong> and <strong>exploration</strong>.\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 No separate screen for fighting. No random encounters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfectly <strong><u>time</u></strong> your <strong><u>hits</u></strong> for for extra damage.   <br>Perfectly <strong><u>time</u></strong> your <strong><u>blocks</u></strong> to prevent damage. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Push Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819510/extras/227589ac0247b9dd2c1ecb908acdffe2.poster.avif?t=1751998674\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819510/extras/227589ac0247b9dd2c1ecb908acdffe2.webm?t=1751998674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819510/extras/227589ac0247b9dd2c1ecb908acdffe2.mp4?t=1751998674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the power of Physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your foes to their death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Elemental Simulation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819510/extras/80f2e5ab471535e9492d57103e23d924.poster.avif?t=1751998674\" width=402 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819510/extras/80f2e5ab471535e9492d57103e23d924.webm?t=1751998674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819510/extras/80f2e5ab471535e9492d57103e23d924.mp4?t=1751998674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire scorches Earth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><str